12-08-89 QMM 3.01, QMMSETUP 3.01, QMMAUTO 3.01
/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

QMM 3.01            Added CTRL and ALT Command Support
                    Added Protocol Translation Table Support
                    Strengthened DATAPAC Logon by sending ".." until
                     DATAPAC is tracked
                    Added scan for "|" in filename of Download List.
                     Will not download if found
                    Now strips space from filename for file transfers

QMMSETUP 3.01       Added View Dialing Directory when configuring
                     Dialing Dir. entries
                    Added Protocol Translation Table
                    Fixed problem where defaults were not being reset
                     when creating a New Profile
                    Fixed Door 3 Prompts not being default
                    Added AutoPilot Recall Option
                    Added AutoPilot Recall Max

QMMAUTO 3.01        Fixed "File not Found" .LOG file problem when no
                     .LOG file exists
                    Added AutoPilot Recall Option when carrier lost


01-24-90 QMM 3.02, QMMSETUP 3.02, QMMAUTO 3.02, QMMAUTOR 3.02
/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

QMM 3.02           Added Linked Profiles
                   Added AutoRecall Mode Support
                   Added Multiple Dialing Directory Support
                   Added Numeric Keypad Support
                   Added Wake Up Support
                   Added Pending Actions Display
                   Added Single key Profile Selection
                   Changed name of AutoPilot Recall to SessionSaver
                   Strengthened Datapac Logon
                   Fixed Renumber when set to Y and Max = 0, Renumber 
                    turned OFF
                   Fixed foreground/background colour resets when BBS
                    sends ANSI reset
                   
QMMSETUP 3.02      Added Linked Profile Support
                   Added Multiple Dialing Directory Support
                   Added Numeric Keypad Support
                   Added Wake Up Support
                   Added Single key Profile Selection
                   
QMMAUTO 3.02       Added AutoRecall Mode Support

QMMAUTOR 3.02      Created AutoRecall Mode 
                   